    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ILENE: Emily? You OK?\nEMILY: I’m so sorry. I just felt sick all of a sudden.\nILENE: They made me sick, too. I had better luck with Celexa.",
      "DRUG REP: We’ll be starting the presentation soon-- so if I can get everyone to come in and take a seat.\nSIEBERT: You sure you don’t want to stay?",
      "EMILY: Thank you for inviting us. I think I saw your dress in a magazine. It’s better on you.\nKAYLA: So sweet. I’m glad you could come.\nEMILY: It’s been so long since I had to get dressed up.\nEMILY: I’m going to the bar -- can I get something for someone?",
      "EMILY: It’s the only idea I have right now.\nKAYLA: Emily looks like she lost weight.",
      "EMILY: I... I was going to work this morning and I felt like I did before-- like I couldn’t keep going. I was on my way to-\nDIERDRE: Do you know her?"
    ]
